          "notes": "ONE checkpoint serves all three presets (19.53 GB). Eight steps by default, euler/simple, sigma shift 12.0 video / 3.0 audio; the distillation is baked in, so there is no Turbo LoRA. The author's guidance for this file: 4 steps fast preview (degraded audio), 6 steps basic, 8 steps quality; the slider covers 4 to 8. MEASURED 2026-11-12 (RTX 4070 Ti 12 GB, 864x480, 5 s, engine 0.45.0, faster attention on): through the app, 86-89 s per text-to-video shot at eight steps and 52 s at four, 97-123 s per image-to-video shot and 92-103 s per reference shot at eight steps (two runs each, about 10 GB of RAM free at the start); engine-direct, four steps took 48-75 s, six 66-93 s and eight 84-142 s over 30 clips. Spectrum step-skipping is deliberately NOT enabled: it garbled a spoken line on the v2 and v3 distills. The author also publishes smaller W6A8 (16.8 GB) and W4A8 (12.5 GB) files; this pack uses the int8 file. THE DOWNLOAD NEEDS A CIVITAI API KEY: the author requires you to be signed in, so add one in Settings before installing. It is a free model, not paid access."
